      "lines": [
        "解方程：",
        "1) $9.5x-(3.2x+1.8x)+3.75=6.9$；",
        "2) $11.3y-(9.7y-0.8y)+7.4=1.7$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "243",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在数轴上表示出下列不等式解的集合：",
        "1) $-2\\leqslant x\\leqslant5$；　　　3) $-6\\leqslant x\\leqslant-1$；",
        "2) $0\\leqslant x\\leqslant7$；　　　 4) $-1\\leqslant x\\leqslant6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "15. 平移"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "过去我们作平行线是沿直尺移动三角板（图 12）. 这时三",
        "角板的所有点都向同一个方向移动相同的距离. 图形的这种",
        "位移就叫做平移."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了给定图形的平移，",
        "只要知道这个图形的一个点",
        "移动到哪里就足够了. 假如",
        "在平移时，点 $A$ 移到点 $A_1$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 58",
      "box": [
        767,
        1391,
        578,
        211
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-58"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 58",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 58"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（图 58）. 要想知道这个图形的 $B$ 点移到哪里，作法如下：联",
        "结点 $A$ 和点 $A_1$，并且从 $B$ 点作和 $AA_1$ 线段平行的线段 $BB_1$，",
        "使它与 $AA_1$ 长度相等、方向相同，于是点 $B$ 移到点 $B_1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
